# Client → niente moduli server

Un Client Component (`"use client"`) **non** deve importare (neanche in transitivo) `next/headers` o `@/lib/supabase/server`. Su Vercel il build esplode:

`You're importing a component that needs "next/headers"…`

## Obbligatorio

- Path / costanti / tipi / pure helpers in file **senza** `createClient` (es. `documenti-paths.ts`, `documenti-permissions-core.ts`)
- Loader server (`getDocumentiSegreteriaFlags`, auth) restano in `*-permissions.ts` / `supabase/server`
- Client: importa solo i moduli “core/paths”

## Check

`npm run lint -w @musicpro/web` esegue `scripts/check-client-server-boundary.mjs` (bloccante in VAI).
